{"step_index":256,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T19:39:53Z","content":"I have removed the background image containing the third-party Netflix logo watermark and replaced it with a clean cinema backdrop featuring the official **StreamWave brand logo watermark** (`/images/streamwave-logo.png`).\n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ Changes Implemented\n\n1. **Replaced Background Image**:\n   - Replaced the stock Unsplash photo containing the faint Netflix logo with a clean, dark cinema backdrop (`https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1489599849927-2ee91cede3ba`).\n\n2. **Added StreamWave Brand Watermark**:\n   - Added a dedicated `.hero-watermark` container in [`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/index.html) positioned centrally behind the hero title.\n   - Applied a subtle, elegant red glow and 8% opacity overlay in [`public/css/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/css/styles.css) displaying the official **StreamWave logo**."}
